## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Zero External Dependency RAG**:
> The embedding pipeline will run locally using `@xenova/transformers` (`all-MiniLM-L6-v2`), meaning RAG vector search operates **100% locally and free** without requiring external vector database subscriptions (like Pinecone) or paid embedding API keys.

> [!TIP]
> **Exact Timecode Citations**:
> Responses generated via RAG will automatically cite exact timestamp ranges (e.g. `[03:10 - 04:00]`), allowing users to click and jump directly to the video segment.

